<section class="app-page progress-page">
  <div class="app-page__hero">
    <div class="app-page__hero-top app-page__hero-top--progress">
      <div class="app-page__hero-unit app-page__hero-copy">
        <span class="app-page__hero-icon">
          <span class="material-symbols-rounded">monitoring</span>
        </span>
        <div>
          <p class="app-page__eyebrow">Rotina e saude</p>
          <h1 class="app-page__title">Progresso</h1>
          <p class="app-page__description">
            Painel leve para acompanhar marcos, consistencia semanal e vitorias que a balanca nao mostra.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="progress-hero-card">
        <span class="progress-hero-card__label">Marco atual</span>
        <% if @latest_weight_entry %>
          <strong><%= number_with_precision(@latest_weight_entry.weight_kg, precision: 2, strip_insignificant_zeros: true, separator: ",") %> kg</strong>
          <small>Medição de <%= @latest_weight_entry.measured_on.strftime("%d/%m/%Y") %></small>
        <% else %>
          <strong>Sem medição</strong>
          <small>Registre seu primeiro peso para começar.</small>
        <% end %>
      </div>

      <div class="progress-hero-card progress-hero-card--accent">
        <span class="progress-hero-card__label">Objetivo maior</span>
        <strong>Abaixo de 100 kg</strong>
        <small>Foco em processo, nao em julgamento diario.</small>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <article class="app-panel progress-panel">
    <div class="progress-history__header">
      <div class="progress-panel__header">
        <span class="material-symbols-rounded">monitor_weight</span>
        <div>
          <p class="app-page__eyebrow">Seus registros</p>
          <h2>Histórico de peso</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <%= link_to "Registrar peso", new_weight_entry_path, class: "app-btn app-btn--primary", data: { turbo: false } %>
    </div>

    <% if @weight_entries.any? %>
      <ul class="progress-history">
        <% @weight_entries.each do |entry| %>
          <li class="progress-history__row">
            <div class="progress-history__measurement">
              <time datetime="<%= entry.measured_on.iso8601 %>"><%= entry.measured_on.strftime("%d/%m/%Y") %></time>
              <strong><%= number_with_precision(entry.weight_kg, precision: 2, strip_insignificant_zeros: true, separator: ",") %> kg</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="progress-history__actions">
              <%= link_to "Editar", edit_weight_entry_path(entry), class: "app-btn app-btn--outline", data: { turbo: false }, aria: { label: "Editar medição de #{entry.measured_on.strftime('%d/%m/%Y')}" } %>
              <%= button_to "Excluir", weight_entry_path(entry), method: :delete, class: "app-btn app-btn--outline", form: { data: { turbo_confirm: "Excluir a medição de #{entry.measured_on.strftime('%d/%m/%Y')}?" } }, aria: { label: "Excluir medição de #{entry.measured_on.strftime('%d/%m/%Y')}" } %>
            </div>
          </li>
        <% end %>
      </ul>
      <%= render "shared/pagination", current_page: @current_page, total_pages: @total_pages, base_params: { controller: "progress", action: "index" }, aria_label: "Histórico de peso" %>
    <% else %>
      <p class="progress-empty">Nenhum peso registrado ainda. Comece quando fizer sentido para você; consistência vale mais que uma medição isolada.</p>
    <% end %>
  </article>

  <div class="progress-grid progress-grid--summary">
    <article class="app-panel progress-panel progress-panel--milestones">
      <div class="progress-panel__header">
        <span class="material-symbols-rounded">flag</span>
        <div>
          <p class="app-page__eyebrow">Marcos</p>
          <h2>Objetivo por etapas</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="progress-milestones" aria-label="Marcos de peso">
        <div class="progress-milestone">
          <span><%= @initial_weight_entry ? "#{number_with_precision(@initial_weight_entry.weight_kg, precision: 2, strip_insignificant_zeros: true, separator: ',')} kg" : "Sem registro" %></span>
          <strong>Referencia</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-milestone <%= 'is-current' if @latest_weight_entry %>">
          <span><%= @latest_weight_entry ? "#{number_with_precision(@latest_weight_entry.weight_kg, precision: 2, strip_insignificant_zeros: true, separator: ',')} kg" : "Sem registro" %></span>
          <strong>Atual</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-milestone <%= 'is-done' if @latest_weight_entry && @latest_weight_entry.weight_kg <= 110 %>">
          <span>110 kg</span>
          <strong>Marco</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-milestone <%= 'is-done' if @latest_weight_entry && @latest_weight_entry.weight_kg <= 105 %>">
          <span>105 kg</span>
          <strong>Marco</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-milestone <%= 'is-done' if @latest_weight_entry && @latest_weight_entry.weight_kg <= 99.9 %>">
          <span>99,9 kg</span>
          <strong>Meta</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="app-panel progress-panel">
      <div class="progress-panel__header">
        <span class="material-symbols-rounded">task_alt</span>
        <div>
          <p class="app-page__eyebrow">Semana</p>
          <h2>Metas que dependem de voce</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="progress-empty">Sugestões de planejamento. Treinos, alimentação e revisão ainda não possuem registros salvos.</p>
      <div class="progress-checklist">
        <div>
          <span>Treinos planejados</span>
          <strong>3</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>Alimentacao planejada</span>
          <strong>5/7</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>Marmitas preparadas</span>
          <strong>Sim</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>Registro da semana</span>
          <strong>Pendente</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="progress-grid">
    <article class="app-panel progress-panel">
      <div class="progress-panel__header">
        <span class="material-symbols-rounded">insights</span>
        <div>
          <p class="app-page__eyebrow">Indicadores</p>
          <h2>Progresso alem da balanca</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="progress-indicators">
        <div class="progress-indicator">
          <span class="material-symbols-rounded">monitor_weight</span>
          <strong>Corpo</strong>
          <small>Peso, media semanal, cintura e roupa de referencia.</small>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-indicator">
          <span class="material-symbols-rounded">fitness_center</span>
          <strong>Treino</strong>
          <small>Quantidade, duracao, carga e sensacao pos-treino.</small>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-indicator">
          <span class="material-symbols-rounded">restaurant</span>
          <strong>Alimentacao</strong>
          <small>Aderencia, fome media e preparacao de marmitas.</small>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-indicator">
          <span class="material-symbols-rounded">psychology</span>
          <strong>Bem-estar</strong>
          <small>Humor, energia, ansiedade e satisfacao com a rotina.</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="app-panel progress-panel">
      <div class="progress-panel__header">
        <span class="material-symbols-rounded">edit_note</span>
        <div>
          <p class="app-page__eyebrow">Revisao</p>
          <h2>Perguntas da semana</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ol class="progress-review">
        <li>O que funcionou esta semana?</li>
        <li>O que atrapalhou?</li>
        <li>Isso estava sob meu controle?</li>
        <li>Existe alguma mudanca util para a proxima semana?</li>
        <li>Qual e a meta minima da proxima semana?</li>
      </ol>
    </article>
  </div>

  <article class="app-panel progress-panel">
    <div class="progress-panel__header">
      <span class="material-symbols-rounded">workspace_premium</span>
      <div>
        <p class="app-page__eyebrow">Historico humano</p>
        <h2>Vitorias que a balanca nao mostra</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="progress-wins">
      <span>Voltar a treinar mesmo sem vontade</span>
      <span>Preparar marmitas</span>
      <span>Caminhar em um dia dificil</span>
      <span>Fazer escolha planejada com fome</span>
      <span>Nao abandonar depois de oscilacao no peso</span>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>
